# ==============================================================================
# Acquisitions API - Trivy Security Policy Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# Policy: Strict zero-tolerance gate for HIGH and CRITICAL vulnerabilities.
# Build/release fails closed (--exit-code 1) on any unresolved HIGH/CRITICAL finding.
#
# Image Construction & Hardening:
# The multi-stage Dockerfile uses a builder stage that prunes non-runtime migration
# and CLI tooling (drizzle-kit, tsx, esbuild). Consequently, no development tooling
# or transitive Go binaries exist in the production runtime container.
#
# Active Suppressions: None (all production runtime packages and OS layers are clean).
# ==============================================================================
